<title>PHILIPPINES: Seafront reports slight net profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Seafront reports slight net profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil explorer Seafront Resources Corp said on Friday it posted a net profit of 3.094 million pesos in 1996. In documents supplied to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the company said total revenues in the year were 14.805 million pesos while expenses were 9.506 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
